CURRENT PROGRESS


Config - Configure payment and Telegram environment:- Update backend/src/types/env.ts.
- Add VietQR bank ID, account number, account name, Telegram bot token, Telegram webhook secret, and admin chat ID.
- Update backend/wrangler.jsonc with non-secret bank display configuration.
- Keep Telegram credentials and sensitive values in Worker secrets.
- Do not add Email handlers, Cron triggers, postal-mime, or KV bindings.


Create customer payment routes:- Create backend/src/routes/payments.ts.
- Add an authenticated package-list endpoint.
- Add an authenticated order-creation endpoint.
- Accept package ID and client request ID.
- Return order ID, order code, package label, credit quantity, VND amount, expiry timestamp, transfer message, QR image URL, and status.
- Add an authenticated customer-confirmation endpoint.
- Accept the order ID from the route.
- Move the order to AWAITING_REVIEW and initiate Telegram notification.
- Make repeated confirmation safe.
- Add an authenticated customer-cancellation endpoint.
- Allow cancellation only while the order is PENDING_TRANSFER.
- Add an authenticated status endpoint.
- Return status, amount, credit quantity, confirmation time, expiry time, and resolution time.
- Return 404 for missing and cross-user orders.
- Mount the router at /v1/payments in backend/src/index.ts.

Create the Telegram service:- Create backend/src/services/telegram.ts.
- Send a review notification after customer confirmation.
- Include order ID, order code, amount, credit quantity, customer identifier, and confirmation time.
- Include an explicit warning requiring bank-app verification before approval.
- Add approve and reject inline buttons.
- Keep callback payloads below Telegram’s size limit.
- Do not include secrets or full customer profile data.
- Treat Telegram network failures as retryable.
- Leave the order in AWAITING_REVIEW when notification delivery fails.

Make customer confirmation retry notification:- Store Telegram notification status as PENDING, SENT, or FAILED.
- When confirmation is repeated, avoid changing the order state or confirmation timestamp.
- Retry Telegram delivery whenever the notification status is not SENT.
- Return success only after notification delivery succeeds.
- Return a retryable gateway error when Telegram delivery fails.
- Keep the same order, status, and confirmation timestamp across retries.

Create the Telegram webhook:- Create backend/src/schema/telegram.ts.
- Validate Telegram updates, callback data, and order IDs.
- Create backend/src/routes/telegram.ts.
- Mount the route before global Supabase authentication middleware in backend/src/index.ts.
- Require the Telegram secret-token header.
- Require the exact configured admin chat ID.
- Return 403 with no side effects for an unknown chat.
- Route approve callbacks to the shared credit-grant RPC.
- Route reject callbacks to the admin-rejection RPC.
- Acknowledge callbacks after processing.
- Show ALREADY_GRANTED for repeated approval clicks.
- Show a clear error when the order is pending customer confirmation, expired, or already cancelled.

UI Data - Implement frontend payment hooks:- Create frontend/src/hooks/queries/usePaymentPackages.ts.
- Create frontend/src/hooks/mutations/useCreatePaymentOrder.ts.
- Create frontend/src/hooks/mutations/useConfirmPayment.ts.
- Create frontend/src/hooks/mutations/useCancelPayment.ts.
- Create frontend/src/hooks/queries/usePaymentStatus.ts.
- Poll every three seconds during the first 90 seconds. (why have to poll?)
- Reduce polling frequency after 90 seconds.
- Stop polling at SUCCESS, CANCELLED, or EXPIRED. (re-think meaning of expire here since user could have taken a photo of the QR before it expired and transfer after)
- Invalidate credit balance and history after SUCCESS.
- Surface retryable notification errors without discarding the active order.

UI Components - Implement the manual-payment UI:- Update frontend/src/routes/credits.tsx.
- Preserve the existing balance and transaction history.
- Add package selection and order creation.
- Display the VietQR image, exact amount, account details, expiry time, and copyable transfer message.
- Add the “Tôi đã chuyển khoản” confirmation button.
- Add a cancellation action only for PENDING_TRANSFER.
- Warn users to confirm only after the transfer completes.
- Show AWAITING_REVIEW with an explanation that an admin will verify the bank transfer manually.
- Show retry guidance when Telegram notification delivery fails.
- After 90 seconds, switch to passive waiting copy.
- Do not promise push notifications.
- Show SUCCESS and the refreshed balance.
- Show CANCELLED with a new-order action.
- Show EXPIRED with a new-order action.
- Follow .agent/design-system/nhuthungfoto/MASTER.md for typography, colors, spacing, focus behavior, responsive layout, accessibility, and 150–300 ms transitions.







Testing - Add backend tests:- Test valid and invalid package IDs.
- Test server-owned package price and credit snapshots.
- Test stale PENDING_TRANSFER orders becoming EXPIRED.
- Test active-order reuse.
- Test same client request ID retry behavior.
- Test concurrent order creation produces only one active order.
- Test cross-user order access returns 404.
- Test confirmation transition and repeated confirmation.
- Test customer cancellation of PENDING_TRANSFER.
- Test that AWAITING_REVIEW cannot be customer-cancelled.
- Test Telegram notification retry.
- Test wrong webhook secret and wrong chat ID.
- Test approval before customer confirmation fails.
- Test approval of expired or cancelled orders fails.
- Test approval grants exact package credits.
